-4,-6).$" 13194139533937 true] [17592186267143 1000 #edb/ref 17592186267144 13194139533937 true] [17592186267143 1000 #edb/ref 17592186267145 13194139533937 true] [17592186267143 1000 #edb/ref 17592186267146 13194139533937 true] [17592186267143 1000 #edb/ref 17592186267147 13194139533937 true] [17592186267143 1000 #edb/ref 17592186267148 13194139533937 true] [17592186267143 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533937 true] [17592186267143 1041 "selection" 13194139533937 true] [17592186267143 1104 #edb/ref 17592186267146 13194139533937 true] [17592186267143 1110 #uuid "da37de31-9a67-5942-83f5-18a5aa8ffe4b" 13194139533937 true] [17592186267144 1034 "(-6,-4)" 13194139533937 true] [17592186267144 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533937 true] [17592186267144 1111 #uuid "be08db7b-05e3-5537-8968-8f794219a493" 13194139533937 true] [17592186267145 1034 "(6,-4)" 13194139533937 true] [17592186267145 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533937 true] [17592186267145 1111 #uuid "a1b2705f-c08e-54ac-81d8-d20bef31bb92" 13194139533937 true] [17592186267146 1034 "(-4,-6)" 13194139533937 true] [17592186267146 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533937 true] [17592186267146 1111 #uuid "372ed86a-17ee-5e1f-aba8-c92f163fe628" 13194139533937 true] [17592186267147 1034 "(4,6)" 13194139533937 true] [17592186267147 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533937 true] [17592186267147 1111 #uuid "685a4859-17e5-5c3d-a199-cbbe6f1a12ac" 13194139533937 true] [17592186267148 1034 "(-4,2)" 13194139533937 true] [17592186267148 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533937 true] [17592186267148 1111 #uuid "ecd90ab1-7c5f-52da-87b0-4cebde4d8500" 13194139533937 true] [17592186267149 1017 #edb/ref 17592186267150 13194139533937 true] [17592186267149 1089 "q-116116" 13194139533937 true] [17592186267149 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139533937 true] [17592186267149 1100 "What is the center of the hyperbola $6{y}^{2}-4{x}^{2}-60y+8x=-122?$" 13194139533937 true] [17592186267149 1113 #uuid "954e8179-80da-5750-a69a-2da4b70ee4e9" 13194139533937 true] [17592186267149 1145 "The equation of a vertical hyperbola centered at $(h,k)$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\frac{(y-k)^{2}}{{a}^{2}}-\\frac{(x-h)^{2}}{{b}^{2}}=1.\n$$\n\nTo rewrite the equation of the hyperbola in the above form, we need to group $x$ and $y$ terms and complete the squares, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}6{y}^{2}-4{x}^{2}-60y+8x & =-122 \\\\ 6{y}^{2}-60y-4{x}^{2}+8x & =-122 \\\\ 6[{y}^{2}-10y]-4[{x}^{2}-2x] & =-122 \\\\ 6[(y-5)^{2}-25]-4[(x-1)^{2}-1] & =-122 \\\\ 6(y-5)^{2}-150-4(x-1)^{2}+4 & =-122 \\\\ 6(y-5)^{2}-4(x-1)^{2} & =-122+150-4 \\\\ 6(y-5)^{2}-4(x-1)^{2} & =24 \\\\ \\frac{(y-5)^{2}}{4}-\\frac{(x-1)^{2}}{6} & =1 \\\\ \\frac{(y-5)^{2}}{{2}^{2}}-\\frac{(x-1)^{2}}{(\\sqrt{6})^{2}} & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, the center is $(1,5).$" 13194139533937 true] [17592186267150 1000 #edb/ref 17592186267151 13194139533937 true] [17592186267150 1000 #edb/ref 17592186267152 13194139533937 true] [17592186267150 1000 #edb/ref 17592186267153 13194139533937 true] [17592186267150 1000 #edb/ref 17592186267154 13194139533937 true] [17592186267150 1000 #edb/ref 17592186267155 13194139533937 true] [17592186267150 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533937 true] [17592186267150 1041 "selection" 13194139533937 true] [17592186267150 1104 #edb/ref 17592186267153 13194139533937 true] [17592186267150 1110 #uuid "86a573af-28de-564d-bbce-e4f73ffdfdc4" 13194139533937 true] [17592186267151 1034 "(6,-4)" 13194139533937 true] [17592186267151 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533937 true] [17592186267151 1111 #uuid "1789ddd2-63ce-5552-af26-c814ec646ed8" 13194139533937 true] [17592186267152 1034 "(-5,-1)" 13194139533937 true] [17592186267152 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533937 true] [17592186267152 1111 #uuid "f05ad2ef-3409-5fda-aea0-7bfbfd58866a" 13194139533937 true] [17592186267153 1034 "(1,5)" 13194139533937 true] [17592186267153 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533937 true] [17592186267153 1111 #uuid "727eaf3e-e97d-58